{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42543","headline":"余迁泉山城留侯招游郡圃作此 · 詹敦仁","name":"余迁泉山城留侯招游郡圃作此","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当年巧匠制茅亭，台馆翬飞匝郡城。\n万竈貔貅戈甲散，千家罗绮管弦鸣。\n柳腰舞罢香风度，花脸粧匀酒晕生。\n试问亭前花与柳，几番衰谢几番荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹敦仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}